2094
02:47:10,331 --> 02:47:11,911
Is anyone being hurt?

2095
02:47:12,431 --> 02:47:13,050
No.

2096
02:47:14,371 --> 02:47:19,965
That was true, on the tenth of June, twenty
twenty-eight. He was careful to notice that

2097
02:47:19,985 --> 02:47:24,094
