2100
02:47:31,724 --> 02:47:33,557
Is that supposed to reassure me?

2101
02:47:34,077 --> 02:47:37,173
It's supposed to be honest. You
asked me for that, too.

2102
02:47:39,192 --> 02:47:40,183
She stayed.

2103
02:47:40,753 --> 02:47:46,148
She would tell herself, for years, that she stayed
because of the equity, which was by

2104
02:47:46,168 --> 02:47:51,690
