2107
02:47:58,054 --> 02:48:03,799
The truth, which she only admitted to herself much
later, on a very bad night, was simpler.

2108
02:48:03,819 --> 02:48:09,566
She stayed because it was the most interesting thing
that had ever happened to her. Because

2109
02:48:09,585 --> 02:48:14,950
he was winning, and she had spent her whole career
watching men like him win, and she

2110
02:48:14,970 --> 02:48:18,119
