2113
02:48:31,522 --> 02:48:32,725
Replace her.

2114
02:48:33,245 --> 02:48:33,865
No.

2115
02:48:34,386 --> 02:48:40,333
Buy a second Pell. A comptroller who cannot ask
questions. A woman who asks where the

2116
02:48:40,352 --> 02:48:43,773
