the bodies are.

2117
02:48:44,293 --> 02:48:45,457
There are no bodies.

2118
02:48:46,977 --> 02:48:47,790
Yet.

2119
02:48:49,809 --> 02:48:55,959
Wesker did not answer that. He drove. And for the
first time, the silence in the car was

2120
02:48:55,979 --> 02:48:59,466
not the silence of a man who had
won the argument.

2121
02:49:01,536 --> 02:49:06,746
That night, in the cold room at the end of the white
corridor, Evelyn Marsh sat on the

2122
02:49:06,766 --> 02:49:12,037
floor in front of the viewing window with her knees
drawn up, and talked to the Tyrant.

2123
02:49:12,606 --> 02:49:18,074
Nobody heard what she said. The four research
associates the Director had bought for her

2124
02:49:18,093 --> 02:49:23,436
