eighteen months before.

2130
02:49:45,784 --> 02:49:50,334
Inside, in the pale mist, the sleeping
thing did not open its eyes.

2131
02:49:50,902 --> 02:49:57,450
But its hand, hanging at its side — its enormous grey
hand — moved. Just once. The fingers

2132
02:49:57,470 --> 02:50:02,996
curled, and uncurled, the way a sleeping
child's hand closes around nothing.

2133
02:50:03,567 --> 02:50:09,948
Evelyn Marsh saw it. She did not tell anyone. She sat
there until the sun came up, a hundred

2134
02:50:28,617 --> 02:50:34,522
In the spring of twenty twenty-eight, Umbrella Life
Sciences had three point two billion

2135
02:50:34,542 --> 02:50:40,448
dollars in the bank, a drug the whole world wanted,
and a problem that money alone could

2136
02:50:40,468 --> 02:50:41,121
