2236
02:58:38,467 --> 02:58:38,850
sheet.

2237
02:58:40,170 --> 02:58:41,224
Ten draws.

2238
02:58:48,036 --> 02:58:49,132
Results.

2239
02:58:59,090 --> 02:58:59,922
Jet lag.

2240
02:59:00,442 --> 02:59:02,322
Fate is mocking you.

2241
02:59:02,841 --> 02:59:08,632
Fate has just made me the only chief executive in
