4737
06:29:19,551 --> 06:29:19,727
it.

4738
06:29:22,546 --> 06:29:26,488
Ability upgrade. Thought acceleration two.

4739
06:29:28,741 --> 06:29:34,421
He bought it on the flight home. Six hundred to one.
A single second became ten minutes.

4740
06:29:34,441 --> 06:29:40,315
And, stranger still, he could run three of them at
once — three separate trains of thought,

4741
06:29:40,335 --> 06:29:46,080
in three separate rooms of the Memory Palace, each
with its own ten minutes, each unaware

4742
06:29:46,100 --> 06:29:49,448
