transaction on Earth.

4775
06:32:35,246 --> 06:32:41,389
It was blocked in March. Lumen had spent twenty
billion dollars on advisors, committed

4776
06:32:41,409 --> 06:32:47,553
its balance sheet, and lost the confidence of every
regulator on three continents. Its

4777
06:32:47,573 --> 06:32:53,717
stock fell forty-four percent. Its board removed
Sebastian Crane as chief executive on

4778
06:32:53,737 --> 06:32:55,150
