4782
06:33:14,927 --> 06:33:18,619
Assessment. Adversarial model defeated.

4783
06:33:26,222 --> 06:33:32,038
Sebastian Crane came to Wilmington in April. Not to
the tower. To the old building on

4784
06:33:32,058 --> 06:33:38,356
the south bank, with its faded bricks and its small
red-and-white sign, where he had somehow

4785
06:33:38,376 --> 06:33:44,398
learned — Oracle, perhaps, one last time — that the
Director still kept an office on the

4786
06:33:44,418 --> 06:33:45,222
