4787
06:33:45,793 --> 06:33:50,573
He stood in the parking lot in the rain until
Hale came out and brought him in.

4788
06:33:51,262 --> 06:33:55,463
It was a trap. The whole six months. You taught it
to predict you, so you could make it

4789
06:33:55,483 --> 06:33:55,754
