4799
06:34:37,353 --> 06:34:41,938
Crane did not want revenge. He wanted to be
near it. Whatever it was.

4800
06:34:42,627 --> 06:34:44,228
He wants to serve.

4801
06:34:44,750 --> 06:34:48,654
He wants to understand. For a man like
him, it's the same thing.

4802
06:34:50,554 --> 06:34:55,561
I can't tell you what I am. But I can offer you a
job. Umbrella has just acquired half

4803
06:34:55,581 --> 06:35:00,587
the drug-discovery servers on Earth, and it has no
one who understands them as well as

4804
06:35:00,607 --> 06:35:05,555
you do. You'd report to me. You'd have no board.
And you would be close enough, every

4805
06:35:05,575 --> 06:35:08,711
day, to keep trying to model me —
and to keep failing.

4806
06:35:11,231 --> 06:35:17,091
Sebastian Crane stood in the corner office with the
water stain shaped like Florida, and

4807
06:35:17,111 --> 06:35:23,106
laughed. It was a strange laugh — half despair, half
delight — and it went on for a while.

4808
06:35:23,795 --> 06:35:25,055
When do I start?

4809
06:35:27,076 --> 06:35:32,957
It was the third time someone had offered themselves
to him in exactly that way. The Adolf

4810
06:35:32,977 --> 06:35:35,253
half of the mind was keeping count.

4811
06:35:35,823 --> 06:35:41,960
Evelyn Marsh, at a piano: can I help? Sir Martin
Ellery, in front of the glass: when do

4812
06:35:41,980 --> 06:35:48,260
I start? And now a boy who had built a machine to see
God, and seen it, and wanted a desk

4813
06:35:48,280 --> 06:35:48,968
beside it.

4814
06:36:09,010 --> 06:36:14,629
There was one company on Earth that Albert Wesker
could not buy, and it was the only one

4815
06:36:14,649 --> 06:36:16,807
that frightened Catherine Adeyemi.

4816
06:36:17,378 --> 06:36:23,643
Tianhe Genomics was headquartered in Shenzhen, in a
tower of green glass that looked across

4817
06:36:23,663 --> 06:36:29,653
the water at Hong Kong. It had begun, twenty years
before, as a gene-sequencing company

4818
06:36:29,673 --> 06:36:36,008
that sold its services cheaply to hospitals across
China, and it had grown, with the patient

4819
06:36:36,028 --> 06:36:42,501
support of the Chinese state, into something that the
American intelligence services described

4820
06:36:42,521 --> 06:36:48,994
in their classified reports as a national champion, and
that Tianhe's own employees described,

4821
