4856
06:39:55,832 --> 06:39:57,903
And if she tries to take you?

4857
06:39:58,422 --> 06:40:03,530
Then I'll learn something about Chinese
intelligence. And she'll learn something about

4858
06:40:03,550 --> 06:40:03,708
me.

4859
06:40:05,730 --> 06:40:07,534
