4900
06:43:30,626 --> 06:43:33,068
That is either a kindness or a threat.

4901
06:43:33,588 --> 06:43:37,319
In my experience, the most useful
things usually are both.

4902
06:43:39,338 --> 06:43:45,215
They talked for two hours. Neither of them lied,
exactly. Neither of them told the truth,

4903
06:43:45,235 --> 06:43:50,913
either. It was, the Director would reflect
afterwards, the most enjoyable conversation

4904
06:43:50,933 --> 06:43:56,545
he had had in either of his lives — two people who
