5733
07:55:22,241 --> 07:55:27,019
percent, and there would be no more arguments
in the car on the drive home.

5734
07:55:46,546 --> 07:55:52,460
Basel is a small city. Two hundred thousand people,
on a bend in the Rhine where three

5735
07:55:52,480 --> 07:55:58,808
countries meet, with a cathedral, a fifteenth-century
university, and a carnival in February

5736
07:55:58,828 --> 07:56:04,673
that the people who live there take more seriously
than anything else in their lives.

5737
07:56:05,243 --> 07:56:10,810
It is also, and has been for a century and a half,
the capital of the world's medicines.

5738
07:56:10,830 --> 07:56:16,397
The great houses grew up there in the
eighteen-hundreds — dye works that discovered that

5739
07:56:16,417 --> 07:56:21,983
the chemistry of colour and the chemistry of the body
are cousins — and they never left.

5740
07:56:22,003 --> 07:56:27,570
By twenty forty-two, four of the six largest
pharmaceutical companies on Earth had their

5741
07:56:27,590 --> 07:56:31,505
