5742
07:56:32,076 --> 07:56:33,783
Three of them were Umbrella.

5743
07:56:35,853 --> 07:56:42,332
Halvorsen Pike had brought the first, in twenty
thirty-two. The second came in thirty-eight,

5744
07:56:42,352 --> 07:56:48,477
and the third in forty-one, and neither was a
