5746
07:56:55,263 --> 07:57:01,571
By twenty forty-two, Umbrella employed thirty-one
thousand people in the canton of Basel-Stadt,

5747
07:57:01,591 --> 07:57:07,965
which had a working population of a hundred and twenty
thousand. It paid, directly, thirty-eight

5748
07:57:07,985 --> 07:57:13,894
percent of the canton's corporate tax. Its foundation
