5773
07:59:29,515 --> 07:59:30,525
A vote.

5774
07:59:31,047 --> 07:59:31,751
A vote.

5775
07:59:32,272 --> 07:59:37,971
I took a country with a vote. They have never
forgiven me for it, and they have spent

5776
07:59:37,991 --> 07:59:40,999
