6998
09:47:09,309 --> 09:47:11,147
I would like to be finished.

6999
09:47:11,717 --> 09:47:18,179
She retired in twenty sixty-two, at seventy-four, after
thirty-five years as chief financial

7000
09:47:18,199 --> 09:47:24,237
officer. She was the last of them. Dana Whitfield
had died in twenty forty-four. Tomás

7001
09:47:24,257 --> 09:47:30,507
Reyes had taken the therapy and then, in twenty
fifty-eight, at sixty, had stopped taking

7002
09:47:30,527 --> 09:47:36,566
