7013
09:48:32,764 --> 09:48:33,892
Don't say it.

7014
09:48:34,413 --> 09:48:35,757
I haven't said anything.

7015
09:48:36,276 --> 09:48:40,408
You're about to. You're going to tell me there's an
infusion, and that it would take an

7016
09:48:40,428 --> 09:48:42,507
