7049
09:50:49,311 --> 09:50:49,951
Yes.

7050
09:50:51,971 --> 09:50:53,158
Thank you.

7051
09:50:55,678 --> 09:51:01,675
She died four days later, in the afternoon, in the
chair by the window, with a book she

7052
09:51:01,695 --> 09:51:03,059
