7091
09:54:33,537 --> 09:54:35,782
Name one who may speak for your world.

7092
09:54:36,352 --> 09:54:41,925
It was not even a debate in the end. It was a fact
that had been true since Geneva in

7093
09:54:41,945 --> 09:54:46,728
twenty forty-seven and had simply never been
